It is hard to trace how the "Interesting..." message is obtained, because
it's at the very bottom of dodip() in potion.c as a catch-all if nothing
else happened.

However, a brief test in wizard mode reveals that if you dip an uncursed
item into plain water and nothing else happens (like scroll erasing), you
get both messages: "Your $foo gets wet.  Interesting..."

Likewise "Interesting..." is obtained when dipping a greased object,
whether or not the grease dissolves.

Hence I infer the OP dipped an uncursed object into plain water.
